<title>HONG KONG: Wo Kee Hong 1996 net loss HK$236.63 mln.</title>
<headline>Wo Kee Hong 1996 net loss HK$236.63 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   21.3 loss   vs 1.8 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	   vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  63.54 gain  vs 10.80 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    236.63 loss vs 18.08 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,697.04    vs 2,945.09</p>
<p>    Company name		 Wo Kee Hong (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Wo Kee Hong is an audiovisual equipment distributor.</p>
<p>Net is after exceptional gain of HK$7.20 million on disposal of land and buildings, gain of HK$11.29 million on disposal of investment property and gain of HK$45.04 million on disposal of overseas listed investment.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs three H.K. cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
